  "notes": [
    "Immutable direct DeFiPlaza runtime contains the removeLiquidity truncation and the zero-reserve swap pricing; later timelock listing swaps and fee change do not touch that arithmetic.",
    "Exact net depletion of the pool's 16 reserves in the single exploit transaction: every reserve fell from its block-20240538 balance to 1 base unit (USDT to 0). Attacker swap and addMultiple inputs were returned within the same transaction and are netted out, so the components are LP-owned assets only. Valued at the last DefiLlama points before the exploit (source-7, 227-289 s earlier); DFP2 has sparse points, so it uses the pre-exploit quote at 1720180509 (source-9) rather than the 1720185404 point taken after the drain, when DFP2 later fell to 0.006. The profit went to an MEV frontrunner copying the original attacker's pending transaction; later recoveries, if any, are not deducted."
